<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 580 mln stg further help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 580 mln stg further help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with a further 580 million stg of further assistance.  </p>
<p>The Bank said it bought 247 million stg in a fixed rate repo at 6.0 percent and 333 million stg of bills outright.</p>
<p>The repos will run to March 24 &amp; 25 and the bills mature on or before March 25.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44-171 542 7715</p>
</text>
